mp\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Connect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left rear light cluster</p></td><td><p>F030A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left rear light cluster</p></td><td><p>F030B</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right tail-light cluster</p></td><td><p>F031A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right tail-light cluster</p></td><td><p>F031B</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Position the tail-light cluster (2a) and secure with studs (2b).</p><p>3. Tighten the fixing bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169002725.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>Connect the negative battery terminal.</p>"]]